---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Methods — TriCel CxnA | iDEC 2026"
  description="Full methods for the CxnA directed evolution project: structure prediction and docking for both Cex and CenA, plasmid construction, error-prone PCR and Gibson Assembly, Congo red/X-gluc screening, and the validated MUC fluorescence assay."
>

  <!-- ═══ PAGE HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Methods</p>
      <h1>Dry lab &amp; wet lab methodology</h1>
      <p>
        What we actually ran, as reported in the project's final write-up — not an idealised
        plan. Every method links to where its results live on the <a href={`${b}/results`}>Results</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ TOC — pill-bar (mobile/tablet) ═══ -->
  <div class="toc-pill-wrap">
    <nav class="toc-pill-bar" aria-label="Jump to method">
      <div class="toc-pill-bar-inner">
        <span class="toc-section-label">Dry lab</span>
        <a href="#method-dl1">DL-1</a>
        <a href="#method-dl2">DL-2</a>
        <a href="#method-dl3">DL-3</a>
        <a href="#method-dl4">DL-4</a>
        <a href="#method-dl5">DL-5</a>
        <div class="toc-divider"></div>
        <span class="toc-section-label">Wet lab</span>
        <a href="#method-wl1">WL-1</a>
        <a href="#method-wl2">WL-2</a>
        <a href="#method-wl3">WL-3</a>
        <a href="#method-wl4">WL-4</a>
        <a href="#method-wl5">WL-5</a>
        <a href="#method-wl6">WL-6</a>
        <a href="#method-wl7">WL-7</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ TOC — fixed sidebar (desktop ≥1380px) ═══ -->
  <aside class="toc-fixed" aria-label="Methods contents">
    <p class="toc-fixed-title">Methods</p>
    <nav>
      <p class="toc-group-head">Dry lab</p>
      <a href="#method-dl1"><span class="toc-id">DL-1</span><span class="toc-label">Structure prediction</span></a>
      <a href="#method-dl2"><span class="toc-id">DL-2</span><span class="toc-label">Cex validation</span></a>
      <a href="#method-dl3"><span class="toc-id">DL-3</span><span class="toc-label">Docking</span></a>
      <a href="#method-dl4"><span class="toc-id">DL-4</span><span class="toc-label">PLIP analysis</span></a>
      <a href="#method-dl5"><span class="toc-id">DL-5</span><span class="toc-label">Mutation screening</span></a>
      <p class="toc-group-head">Wet lab</p>
      <a href="#method-wl1"><span class="toc-id">WL-1</span><span class="toc-label">Culture &amp; plates</span></a>
      <a href="#method-wl2"><span class="toc-id">WL-2</span><span class="toc-label">Plasmid &amp; DNA quant</span></a>
      <a href="#method-wl3"><span class="toc-id">WL-3</span><span class="toc-label">Library generation</span></a>
      <a href="#method-wl4"><span class="toc-id">WL-4</span><span class="toc-label">CMC / Congo red</span></a>
      <a href="#method-wl5"><span class="toc-id">WL-5</span><span class="toc-label">X-gluc screen</span></a>
      <a href="#method-wl6"><span class="toc-id">WL-6</span><span class="toc-label">MUC / MUG assay</span></a>
      <a href="#method-wl7"><span class="toc-id">WL-7</span><span class="toc-label">Sequencing</span></a>
    </nav>
  </aside>

  <!-- ═══ WORKFLOW OVERVIEW ═══ -->
  <section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="workflow-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Project workflow</p>
        <h2 id="workflow-heading">One mutant library, three screens, then sequencing</h2>
        <p>
          Dry-lab structure prediction and docking ran as its own track to prioritise where
          mutations might matter — but the actual mutagenesis was random (error-prone PCR), not
          computationally targeted. A single mutant library was screened through Congo red,
          X-gluc, and the MUC assay in sequence, each step narrowing down which colonies were
          worth sequencing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pipeline SVG -->
      <figure class="pipeline-figure" aria-labelledby="pipeline-svg-title">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 780 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pipeline-svg" aria-labelledby="pipeline-svg-title">
